# Input
```astro
---
---
<!-- should not generate diagnostics -->

<!-- valid boolean values -->
<div aria-hidden="true">content</div>

<!-- valid tristate -->
<span aria-checked="mixed">some text</span>

<div role="grid" aria-rowcount={count}></div>

<!-- template literals with interpolations are evaluated at runtime -->
<button type="button" aria-pressed=`${view === 'cards' ? 'true' : 'false'}`>Button</button>

```
